  "name": "Open Crab",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Self-maintaining system toolkit for Claude Code\n4 commands: /daily (patrol scheduler), /disk-clean (current directory cleanup), /security (system security scan), /evolve (plugin self-healing)\nCross-platform: Windows / macOS / Linux\nSelf-improving loop: daily logs feed back into evolve for automatic command maintenance",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Commands** (4): `daily`, `disk-clean`, `evolve`, `security`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `open-crab-llm`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install open-crab@claude-community` from `jay2zxy/Open-Crab`.\n\nSelf-maintaining system toolkit for Claude Code. Set up the ecosystem and it runs itself.",
